ac{7\\pi }{6}) & =\\operatorname{cos}⁡x\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{7\\pi }{6})+\\operatorname{sin}⁡x\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{7\\pi }{6}) \\\\  & =\\operatorname{cos}⁡x(-\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2})+\\operatorname{sin}⁡x(-\\frac{1}{2}) \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{2}\\,\\operatorname{sin}⁡x-\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}\\,\\operatorname{cos}⁡x.\\end{aligned}\n$$"}]}
